<p><script async src="//platform.instagram.com/en_US/embeds.js"></script></p>
<p>It would most likely be a mistake to kick off the month without talking about the upcoming release of Magic&#8217;s new set: Marvel Super Heroes. Marvel Super Heroes sealed product will be available for purchase during prerelease weekend at The Gathering Place, no preorders for sealed product or singles are being taken at TGP. For those interested in preregistering for the prerelease events at TGP, here&#8217;s links to each day:</p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><strong>Friday</strong></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-19-2-30pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>2:30 p.m. Prerelease Sealed</em></a></span><br />
<a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-19-7-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">7:00 p.m. FNM Prerelease Sealed</span></em></a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><strong>Saturday</strong></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-20-12-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>12:00 p.m. Prerelease Sealed</em></a></span><br />
<a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-20-4-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">4:00 p.m. Prerelease Sealed</span></em></a></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><strong>Sunday</strong></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-2hg-prerelease-6-21-12-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">12:00 p.m. Prerelease Sealed 2HG</span></em></a></p>
<p>You&#8217;ll hear  more about that in the next couple weeks, obviously. Same for the Pride Party and Pride Tournament, and all the other stuff this month. We&#8217;re already working on July, we&#8217;re excited for summer in town, and we&#8217;ll see you around!</p>
</article><!-- #post-4729 -->                
<article class="tgp-post" id="post-4723">
	<h2>June &#8217;26 at The Gathering Place</h2>	<div class="tgp-date-and-time">
		<div class="tgp-date"></div>
		<div class="tgp-time">5:56 pm</div>
	</div>
			<div class="tgp-categories">
							<a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/category/board-certified/" class="tgp-category-chip">
					Board Certified				</a>
							<a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/category/tgp-events/" class="tgp-category-chip">
					TGP Events				</a>
					</div>
		<hr />
	<h1><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="4727" data-permalink="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2026/06/02/june-26-at-the-gathering-place/june/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/June.png?fit=851%2C315&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="851,315" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="June" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/June.png?fit=640%2C237&amp;ssl=1" class="aligncenter wp-image-4727 size-full" src="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/June.png?resize=640%2C237&#038;ssl=1" alt="" width="640" height="237" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/June.png?w=851&amp;ssl=1 851w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/June.png?resize=300%2C111&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/June.png?resize=768%2C284&amp;ssl=1 768w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /></h1>
<hr />
<p><em>Product Release(s) in June: MTG UB: Marvel Superheroes, One Piece TCG OP-16</em></p>
<hr />
<h3>D&amp;D Learn to Play</h3>
<p><em>Wednesday, June 3, 6:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>The first Wednesday of each month, TGP&#8217;s own Ben Creed (a friendly face known for comedy, trivia, and TCG excellence in both One Piece and MTG) will be your guide as you take your first steps into the Forgotten Realms.</p>
<p>The Learn to Play session starts at 6:00 p.m. and players don&#8217;t have to provide anything but themselves. Well, themselves and also a general openness, a will to learn and the expectation that role playing might feel a little goofy at first — but, the knowledge that the more you lean into it the more fun you&#8217;ll have. If you&#8217;ve always been D&amp;D curious, if you&#8217;ve seen it portrayed in popular media, if you&#8217;ve been watching actual play shows or listening to podcasts like Dimension 20 or Critical Role, this is your opportunity to start your own story!</p>
<hr />
<h3>Girlypop Magic Commander Night</h3>
<p><em>Thursday, June 4, 6:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>We are honored to be hosting local femme-forward all-stars Girlypop Magic the first Thursday of each month at The Gathering Place! Join us for a free and fun night of MTG Commander-focused events for femme, non-binary, and gender expansive folks!</p>
<p>GPM comes by TGP every month, so come back the first Thursday and play some fun games with some truly excellent people!</p>
<p><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://girlypopmagic.com/">Check out the Girly Pop Magic page(s) for all the details</a> </span>and some truly wonderful posts</p>
<hr />
<h3>cEDH Monthly Dual Land Tournament</h3>
<p><em>Saturday, June 6, 12:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>Each month, The Gathering Place holds a CEDH tournament where the prize is based on attendance, and every entrant has a chance to battle it out for a Dual Land straight out of the TGP display case!</p>
<p>This month&#8217;s is on Saturday, June 6, starting at noon.</p>
<p>$30 buy in, Dual Land goes to first place, payout prizing to Top 4, and other / additional prizing based on attendance. Come battle it out for Duals, for glory, for love of the game!</p>
<p>Full proxy is permitted, all proxies must be clearly representative of the intended card and contain all information the official printing does in an easy-to-identify fashion.</p>
<p>Event registration is run through TopDeck. (<span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://topdeck.gg/thegatheringplace">https://topdeck.gg/thegatheringplace</a></span>)</p>
<hr />
<h3>One Piece OP-16 Prerelease Event</h3>
<p><em>Sunday, June 7, 1:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>The Time of Battle is RIGHT NOW, One Piece TCG players! OP-16 prerelease is the new set, based on the Paramount War, and things are heating up with new Leaders, new treatments, and a boatload more from One Piece&#8217;s trading card game component.</p>
<p>Entry is $30 per player, TGP will have promos and Bandai-provided prizing as per usual. This event is capped at 32, so snag those preregistrations sooner rather than later!</p>
<p><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://www.bandai-tcg-plus.com/event/5568273"><em>Event Details + Registration</em></a></span></p>
<hr />
<h3>MTG Vintage Cash Tournament (Monthly MTG Series)</h3>
<p><em>Saturday, June 13, 12:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>The Gathering Place&#8217;s monthly cash tournament series continues in June with another Vintage Cash tourney!</p>
<p><a href="https://magic.wizards.com/en/formats/vintage">Vintage</a> is powerful, expansive and a popular way to play competitive MTG! Every card, every set, spanning decades of Magic and shaped by the future of the game itself.</p>
<p>At TGP, Vintage tournament decks are full throttle, and full proxy is permitted. All proxies must be clearly identifiable across the table and representative of actual MTG cards.</p>
<p>Entry is $30 per player to clash for cash in Magic&#8217;s most expansive and highest power format, and that entry contributes to the prize pool, along with bonus prizes added to the pot by TGP itself. For this month&#8217;s Vintage tournament? We&#8217;ve got a Demonic Tutor in the pool!</p>
<p>Every card, every era, possibilities and combos abound!</p>
<p><a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-vintage-cash-tournament/"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Event Details + Registration</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<h3>MTG Five-Color Pride Tournament</h3>
<p><em>Sunday, June 14, 12:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>All decks have a mandatory mana base of five colors. All Legendary creatures and Commander-eligible cards have Partner, but your deck MUST include all five colors! $10 entry per player, half of that goes straight to charity. We&#8217;ll have raffles and all kinds of fun stuff all day long. All game changers are banned!</p>
<p><a href="https://topdeck.gg/event/mtg-five-color-pride-tournament"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Event Details + Registration</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<h3>MTG Universes Beyond: Marvel Superheroes Prerelease Weekend</h3>
<p><em>Friday, June 19 &#8211; Sunday, June 21</em></p>
<p>The next entry in Magic&#8217;s expansive Multiverse collides with another setting that&#8217;s continually racking up the cosmic scoreboard: Marvel Comics! We&#8217;ve seen glimpses of what&#8217;s coming in June through Secret Lair releases and Spider-Man&#8217;s MTG debut, and the release of Marvel Superheroes in MTG promises to be another set going bigger!</p>
<p><em>Marvel Superheroes sealed product will be available for purchase during prerelease weekend at The Gathering Place, no preorders for sealed product or singles are being taken at TGP.</em></p>
<p><strong>Friday</strong></p>
<p><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-19-2-30pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>2:30 p.m. Prerelease Sealed</em></a></span><br />
<a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-19-7-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">7:00 p.m. FNM Prerelease Sealed</span></em></a></p>
<p><strong>Saturday</strong></p>
<p><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-20-12-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>12:00 p.m. Prerelease Sealed</em></a></span><br />
<a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-prerelease-6-20-4-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">4:00 p.m. Prerelease Sealed</span></em></a></p>
<p><strong>Sunday</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-marvel-super-heroes-2hg-prerelease-6-21-12-00pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">12:00 p.m. Prerelease Sealed 2HG</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<h3>MTG Pauper Cash Tournament (MTGPunks Series)</h3>
<p><em>Saturday, June 27, 12:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p><a href="https://magic.wizards.com/en/formats/pauper">Pauper</a> is the &#8220;oops! all commons!&#8221; format of MTG where low-rarity cards produce some interesting, fun, shockingly complex gameplay.</p>
<p>While TGP is proxy-friendly in a great many cases, all cards played in Pauper tournaments must be the real deal.</p>
<p>Entry per player is $30, entry goes back to the prize pool, and the MTGPunks tournament series continues with additional bonus prizing straight from the Dungeon for each tournament! For this month&#8217;s Pauper tournament, that prize is an especially pretty Dom! art Counterspell, the DCI Legend Membership printing!</p>
<p><a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/events/mtg-pauper-cash-tournament/"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Event Details + Registration</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<h3>Riftbound Summoner&#8217;s Skirmish</h3>
<p><em>Sunday, June 28, 1:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>Riftbound continues to be a hit at TGP and beyond, and we&#8217;ll be closing out May with another Summoner&#8217;s Skirmish!</p>
<p>This tournament will be run at a competitive rules enforcement level. 32 player maximum, $20 entry per player, Swiss rounds followed by a cut to top. If you&#8217;ve ever wanted to give serious competitive Riftbound play a shot, now&#8217;s your chance!</p>
<p><a href="https://locator.riftbound.uvsgames.com/events/409434"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Event Details + Registration</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<h3>Castaway Commander League: Week One</h3>
<p><em>Tuesday, June 30 &#8211; Saturday, August 22</em></p>
<p>Last year, we laid down a solid foundation – Commander League: Summer Session was a surprise smash hit, and became the inspiration for so much more we’ve been doing at The Gathering Place since.</p>
<p>To that end, for 2026, we are delighted to introduce something entirely new for the Summer League at TGP: Castaway League.</p>
<p>If you&#8217;d like to know everything there is to know about Castaway League at TGP, here&#8217;s our post with details:</p>
<p><em><a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2024/05/14/castaway-league-26-at-the-gathering-place/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color: #ffcc00;">https://gatheringplacegames.com/2024/05/14/castaway-league-26-at-the-gathering-place/</span></a></em></p>
<hr />
<blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/p/DZGKajUD6lv/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" data-instgrm-version="14" style=" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:640px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);">
