<article class="tgp-post" id="post-4697">
	<h2>TGP Dispatch 5/26/26: Third Age, Old School and D&#038;D</h2>	<div class="tgp-date-and-time">
		<div class="tgp-date">May 26, 2026</div>
		<div class="tgp-time">5:15 pm</div>
	</div>
			<div class="tgp-categories">
							<a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/category/weekly-annoucements/tgp-dispatch/" class="tgp-category-chip">
					TGP Dispatch				</a>
							<a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/category/weekly-annoucements/" class="tgp-category-chip">
					Weekly Annoucements				</a>
					</div>
		<hr />
	<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/events-page/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><strong>TGP Events Page</strong></em></a></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jut0TLxHDOo1fQkL91lKqt-EmDBdwZ4QsUhhPHToCLY/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><strong><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Monthly Calendar for The Gathering Place in Google Sheets</span></strong></em></a></p>
<hr />
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="4699" data-permalink="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2026/05/26/tgp-dispatch-third-age-old-school/dispatch-template-9/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dispatch-template-4.png?fit=851%2C315&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="851,315" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="dispatch template" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dispatch-template-4.png?fit=640%2C237&amp;ssl=1" class="aligncenter wp-image-4699 size-full" src="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dispatch-template-4.png?resize=640%2C237&#038;ssl=1" alt="" width="640" height="237" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dispatch-template-4.png?w=851&amp;ssl=1 851w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dispatch-template-4.png?resize=300%2C111&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dispatch-template-4.png?resize=768%2C284&amp;ssl=1 768w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /></p>
<hr />
<p>This week at The Gathering Place, we&#8217;re sending the month of May off with a full weekend! Flesh and Blood is running a prerelease this Friday, there&#8217;s an MTG Old School Cash tournament, and Sunday features a Riftbound Summoner&#8217;s Skirmish plus another round of combat-focused D&amp;D with Kelly!</p>
<p>Find all the details over on the <a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/events-page/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color: #ffcc00;">TGP events page</span></a>, and here&#8217;s the details taken straight for there for folks who don&#8217;t like to click links.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Flesh and Blood: Omens of the Third Age Prerelease</h3>
<p><em>Friday, May 29, 7:30 p.m.</em></p>
<p>A new FAB release, a new Friday stacked with stuff!</p>
<p><a href="https://fabtcg.com/locator/the-gathering-place/"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Event Details + Registration</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<h3>MTG Old School Cash Tournament (MTGPunks Series)</h3>
<p><em>Saturday, May 30, 12:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>The MTGPunks tournament series at TGP is a monthly rotating cash tournament series of community-driven and fan-favorite formats for Magic.</p>
<p>May is Old School&#8217;s turn in the sun. We&#8217;re talking $30 entry! All Buy in going back into the prize pool! Old School at The Gathering Place, played using the <a href="https://www.eternalcentral.com/oldschool/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Eternal Central guidelines</span></a>!</p>
<p>Play Magic the way that Richard Garfield intended; with a nostalgic card pool from Alpha to Fallen Empires—where every deck is a time machine! Relive the aesthetics and power of iconic cards and strategic depth from &#8217;93-&#8217;94, all while embracing the charm of old-school gameplay.</p>
<p><a href="https://the-gathering-place.mybigcommerce.com/mtg-old-school-cash-tournament/"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Event Details + Registration</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<h3>Riftbound Summoner&#8217;s Skirmish</h3>
<p><em>Sunday, May 31, 1:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>Riftbound continues to be a hit at TGP and beyond, and we&#8217;ll be closing out May with another Summoner&#8217;s Skirmish!</p>
<p>This tournament will be run at a competitive rules enforcement level. 32 player maximum, $20 entry per player, Swiss rounds followed by a cut to top. If you&#8217;ve ever wanted to give serious competitive Riftbound play a shot, now&#8217;s your chance!</p>
<p><a href="https://locator.riftbound.uvsgames.com/events/409434"><em><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Event Details + Registration</span></em></a></p>
<hr />
<p>As we announced last week, we&#8217;re switching up how we&#8217;re running MTG Drafts at TGP in June. You can <span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2026/05/26/mtg-drafts-at-tgp-in-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read the full announcement here</a></span>, if you missed it. TL;DR &#8212; FNM Drafts are always going to be new, Standard sets. Sunday Drafts will be special events with sealed product pulled from the Distro Dungeon vaults.</p>
<p>We also introduced the next Commander League concept last week, the Castaway League, which kicks off at the very end of June.  <em><a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2024/05/14/castaway-league-26-at-the-gathering-place/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Click here for our full post about Castaway Commander League, with all the details about the event</span></a>. </em>But, that&#8217;s a ways away &#8212; and you&#8217;ll see a full &#8220;June at TGP&#8221; post later this week with all the breakdowns, events, outlines, and everything else you&#8217;re expecting. For now, know we&#8217;re excited about Pride weekend in June, with our party on Saturday and a 5-Color Commander MTG x Pride Tournament on Sunday. We&#8217;ll have more posts soon, but we had to let the Pride Possum do an intro today.</p>
