<hr />
<p>Since it is about to Graduation Weekend for UNC, now is as good a time as any to remind folks about<span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/tgps-parking/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> our guide to parking at / for TGP</a></span>. Everybody be safe, have fun, and enjoying showing your folks around town. Congrats to all grads, good luck to the rest of you if you&#8217;re trying to be in the streets this weekend.</p>
<p>That about wraps up this week&#8217;s Dispatch! We&#8217;ll see you next week, and we&#8217;ll see you Saturday-after-next at COMMANDERJAM!</p>
