<article class="tgp-post" id="post-4554">
	<h2>TGP Dispatch: 4/28/26</h2>	<div class="tgp-date-and-time">
		<div class="tgp-date">April 28, 2026</div>
		<div class="tgp-time">5:59 pm</div>
	</div>
			<div class="tgp-categories">
							<a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/category/weekly-annoucements/tgp-dispatch/" class="tgp-category-chip">
					TGP Dispatch				</a>
							<a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/category/weekly-annoucements/" class="tgp-category-chip">
					Weekly Annoucements				</a>
					</div>
		<hr />
	<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffcc00;"><a style="color: #ffcc00;" href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/events-page/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><strong>TGP Events Page</strong></em></a></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jut0TLxHDOo1fQkL91lKqt-EmDBdwZ4QsUhhPHToCLY/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em><strong><span style="color: #ffcc00;">Monthly Calendar for The Gathering Place in Google Sheets</span></strong></em></a></p>
<hr />
<p><img data-recalc-dims="1" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="4560" data-permalink="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2026/04/28/tgp-dispatch-4-28-26/dispatch-template-4/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/dispatch-template-1.png?fit=851%2C315&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="851,315" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="dispatch template" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/dispatch-template-1.png?fit=640%2C237&amp;ssl=1" class="aligncenter wp-image-4560 size-full" src="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/dispatch-template-1.png?resize=640%2C237&#038;ssl=1" alt="" width="640" height="237" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/dispatch-template-1.png?w=851&amp;ssl=1 851w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/dispatch-template-1.png?resize=300%2C111&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/dispatch-template-1.png?resize=768%2C284&amp;ssl=1 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /></p>
<hr />
<p>This week, The Gathering Place formally concludes April, welcomes May, and congratulates all UNC students on surviving LDOC weekend and wishes them all a commensurate amount of luck on exams.</p>
<p>The Alpha Pie x Sangam LDOC Patio Party was a smashing success in its second iteration, pushed along in no small part by how absolutely slamming the two specialty slices were. Chicken Tikka and Saag Paneer really blew the doors off, shoutout to everyone who came by to get one!</p>
<figure id="attachment_4557" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-4557" style="width: 640px" class="wp-caption aligncenter"><img data-recalc-dims="1" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="4557" data-permalink="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2026/04/28/tgp-dispatch-4-28-26/img_20260427_181421702_hdr/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR.webp?fit=921%2C1223&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="921,1223" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR.webp?fit=640%2C850&amp;ssl=1" class="wp-image-4557 size-large" src="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR.webp?resize=640%2C850&#038;ssl=1" alt="" width="640" height="850" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR.webp?resize=771%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 771w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR.webp?resize=226%2C300&amp;ssl=1 226w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR.webp?resize=768%2C1020&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/gatheringplacegames.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_20260427_181421702_HDR.webp?w=921&amp;ssl=1 921w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-4557" class="wp-caption-text">look at &#8217;em. gorgeous, golden hour slices</figcaption></figure>
<p>We talked a good bit about Commanderjam last week and we&#8217;ll certainly talk a lot more about Commanderjam next week, so we&#8217;ll save most of that for the next Dispatch. In the meantime, May is wrapped and ready to go.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://gatheringplacegames.com/2026/04/28/may-26-at-the-gathering-place/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>TGP published the list of events on the calendar for May earlier today, so click here for the full post with details, links, etc</em></a></p>
<p>In the more immediate, this weekend, we&#8217;ve got two big things on the calendar — our cEDH monthly Dual Land Tournament and the official TGP prerelease event for Riftbound&#8217;s new set: Unleashed! Here&#8217;s the details for each:</p>
<hr />
<h3>cEDH Monthly Dual Land Tournament</h3>
<p><em>Saturday, May 2, 12:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>Each month, The Gathering Place holds a CEDH tournament where the prize is based on attendance, and every entrant has a chance to battle it out for a Dual Land straight out of the TGP display case!</p>
<p>This month&#8217;s is on Saturday, May 2, starting at noon.</p>
<p>$30 buy in, Dual Land goes to first place, payout prizing to Top 4, and other / additional prizing based on attendance. Come battle it out for Duals, for glory, for love of the game!</p>
<p>Full proxy is permitted, all proxies must be clearly representative of the intended card and contain all information the official printing does in an easy-to-identify fashion.</p>
<p>Link:</p>
<p>Event registration is run through TopDeck. (<a href="https://topdeck.gg/thegatheringplace">https://topdeck.gg/thegatheringplace</a>)</p>
<hr />
<h3>Riftbound Unleashed Prerelease Event / Tournament</h3>
<p><em>Sunday, May 3, 1:00 p.m.</em></p>
<p>The next set in Riftbound is here! Colorful characters, new styles of play, more of what you play Riftbound for is about to be Unleashed!</p>
<p>The Gathering Place will host our Unleashed prerelease event on May 3, through carde.io (like all the other Riftbound events at TGP.) Unleashed&#8217;s prerelease is $30 entry per player with a 32 player cap, prizing for the prerelease is powered by event promos and additional store prizing from TGP based on attendance. See you there!</p>
<p><em><a href="https://locator.riftbound.uvsgames.com/events/407825">Event Details + Registration</a></em></p>
<hr />
<p>As always, thanks for reading! If you haven&#8217;t checked in on the TGP Online Store in the past week or so, a great deal of new inventory has been uploaded. Even though the team in the Distro Dungeon is frantically searching and mystically retrieving and unearthing all kinds of rad stuff to get properly ready for the journey out to MagicCon: Las Vegas and beyond — there&#8217;s a fresh crop of cool singles for you to check out, if you&#8217;re so inclined.</p>
<p>Until next time, be cool, be safe, see you around!</p>
<p><em>(also have you tried the Schrödinger&#8217;s Lager yet?) </em></p>
<blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DXmJZ-Svldi/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" data-instgrm-version="14" style=" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:640px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);">
<div style="padding:16px;"> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DXmJZ-Svldi/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" style=" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;" target="_blank"> </p>
<div style=" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;">
<div style="background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;"></div>
